#: src/stdlib/fs.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry implements Node.js file system APIs for reading, writing, and managing "
"files."
msgstr ""
"Perry triển khai các API hệ thống tập tin của Node.js để đọc, ghi và quản lý "
"tập tin."

#: src/stdlib/fs.md:5
msgid "Reading Files"
msgstr "Đọc tập tin"

#: src/stdlib/fs.md:7
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const configPath = join(scratch, \"config.json\")\n"
"const content = readFileSync(configPath, \"utf-8\")\n"
"console.log(content)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const configPath = join(scratch, \"config.json\")\n"
"const content = readFileSync(configPath, \"utf-8\")\n"
"console.log(content)\n"
"```"

#: src/stdlib/fs.md:13
msgid "Binary File Reading"
msgstr "Đọc tập tin nhị phân"

#: src/stdlib/fs.md:15
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const imagePath = join(scratch, \"image.png\")\n"
"const buffer = fs.readFileBuffer(imagePath)\n"
"console.log(`Read ${buffer.length} bytes`)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const imagePath = join(scratch, \"image.png\")\n"
"const buffer = fs.readFileBuffer(imagePath)\n"
"console.log(`Read ${buffer.length} bytes`)\n"
"```"

#: src/stdlib/fs.md:21
msgid ""
"`readFileBuffer` reads files as binary data (uses `fs::read()` internally, "
"not `read_to_string()`)."
msgstr ""
"`readFileBuffer` đọc tập tin dưới dạng dữ liệu nhị phân (dùng `fs::read()` "
"bên trong, không phải `read_to_string()`)."

#: src/stdlib/fs.md:23
msgid "Writing Files"
msgstr "Ghi tập tin"

#: src/stdlib/fs.md:25
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const outputPath = join(scratch, \"output.txt\")\n"
"const dataPath = join(scratch, \"data.json\")\n"
"writeFileSync(outputPath, \"Hello, World!\")\n"
"writeFileSync(dataPath, JSON.stringify({ key: \"value\" }, null, 2))\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const outputPath = join(scratch, \"output.txt\")\n"
"const dataPath = join(scratch, \"data.json\")\n"
"writeFileSync(outputPath, \"Hello, World!\")\n"
"writeFileSync(dataPath, JSON.stringify({ key: \"value\" }, null, 2))\n"
"```"

#: src/stdlib/fs.md:32
msgid "File Information"
msgstr "Thông tin tập tin"

#: src/stdlib/fs.md:41
msgid "Directory Operations"
msgstr "Các thao tác trên thư mục"

#: src/stdlib/fs.md:43
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// Create directory\n"
"const outDir = join(scratch, \"output\")\n"
"if (!existsSync(outDir)) mkdirSync(outDir)\n"
"\n"
"// Read directory contents\n"
"const files = readdirSync(scratch)\n"
"for (const file of files) {\n"
"    console.log(file)\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Remove an empty directory\n"
"rmdirSync(outDir)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// Create directory\n"
"const outDir = join(scratch, \"output\")\n"
"if (!existsSync(outDir)) mkdirSync(outDir)\n"
"\n"
"// Read directory contents\n"
"const files = readdirSync(scratch)\n"
"for (const file of files) {\n"
"    console.log(file)\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Remove an empty directory\n"
"rmdirSync(outDir)\n"
"```"

#: src/stdlib/fs.md:58
msgid ""
"For recursive removal Perry exposes `rmRecursive` (a thin wrapper around "
"`std::fs::remove_dir_all`). Wired via [\\#193](https://github.com/PerryTS/"
"perry/issues/193) through `js_fs_rm_recursive` in the LLVM backend."
msgstr ""
"Đối với xóa đệ quy, Perry cung cấp `rmRecursive` (một lớp bọc mỏng quanh "
"`std::fs::remove_dir_all`). Được nối thông qua [\\#193](https://github.com/"
"PerryTS/perry/issues/193) qua `js_fs_rm_recursive` trong backend LLVM."

#: src/stdlib/fs.md:63
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { rmRecursive } from \"fs\";\n"
"rmRecursive(\"output\"); // Recursive remove; returns 1 on success, 0 on "
"failure.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { rmRecursive } from \"fs\";\n"
"rmRecursive(\"output\"); // Recursive remove; returns 1 on success, 0 on "
"failure.\n"
"```"

#: src/stdlib/fs.md:68
msgid "Path Utilities"
msgstr "Các tiện ích đường dẫn"

