#: src/i18n/interpolation.md:112
msgid "Explicit API for Non-UI Strings"
msgstr "API tường minh cho chuỗi ngoài UI"

#: src/i18n/interpolation.md:114
msgid ""
"For strings outside UI components (API responses, notifications, etc.), use "
"`t()`:"
msgstr ""
"Đối với các chuỗi nằm ngoài thành phần UI (phản hồi API, thông báo, v.v.), "
"hãy dùng `t()`:"

#: src/i18n/interpolation.md:116
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// For strings outside UI components (API responses, notifications, …), use "
"t():\n"
"const message = t(\"Your order has been shipped.\")\n"
"const welcome = t(\"Welcome back, {name}!\", { name: \"Alice\" })\n"
"console.log(message, welcome)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// For strings outside UI components (API responses, notifications, …), use "
"t():\n"
"const message = t(\"Your order has been shipped.\")\n"
"const welcome = t(\"Welcome back, {name}!\", { name: \"Alice\" })\n"
"console.log(message, welcome)\n"
"```"

#: src/i18n/interpolation.md:123
msgid ""
"This uses the same key lookup, locale selection, and interpolation as UI "
