#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:234
msgid ""
"`napi_create_function` allocates a Perry closure whose captured host record "
"contains the native callback pointer, addon data pointer, name, and "
"environment id. A shared rest-argument trampoline constructs a stack-local "
"`napi_callback_info` containing rooted argument handles, `this`, callback "
